From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:08:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/aom_film_grain: reject scaling points with a repeated
 x value

The AV1 specification requires the points to be strictly increasing,
and the AFGS1 scaling function is undefined for equal x values.

Fixes: xaXnd8wemUUh/testcase/afgs1_dup.hevc
Fixes: xaXnd8wemUUh
Fixes: AISLE-2026-0150-00067
Fixes: division by zero
Division by zero Replicated through UnModified FFmpeg with UBSAN

Found-by: Joshua Rogers (AISLE)

Signed-off-by: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>
---
 libavcodec/aom_film_grain.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavcodec/aom_film_grain.c b/libavcodec/aom_film_grain.c
index bb60c55774..205e93604f 100644
--- a/libavcodec/aom_film_grain.c
+++ b/libavcodec/aom_film_grain.c
@@ -247,7 +247,7 @@ int ff_aom_parse_film_grain_sets(AVFilmGrainAFGS1Params *s,
                 bits_scaling = get_bits(gb, 2) + 5;
                 for (i = 0; i < aom->num_y_points; i++) {
                     y_value += get_bits(gb, bits_inc);
-                    if (y_value > UINT8_MAX)
+                    if (y_value > UINT8_MAX || i && y_value == aom->y_points[i - 1][0])
                         goto error;
                     aom->y_points[i][0] = y_value;
                     aom->y_points[i][1] = get_bits(gb, bits_scaling);
@@ -298,7 +298,7 @@ int ff_aom_parse_film_grain_sets(AVFilmGrainAFGS1Params *s,
                         uv_offset = get_bits(gb, 8);
                         for (i = 0; i < aom->num_uv_points[uv]; i++) {
                             uv_value += get_bits(gb, bits_inc);
-                            if (uv_value > UINT8_MAX)
+                            if (uv_value > UINT8_MAX || i && uv_value == aom->uv_points[uv][i - 1][0])
                                 goto error;
                             aom->uv_points[uv][i][0] = uv_value;
                             aom->uv_points[uv][i][1] = get_bits(gb, bits_scaling) + uv_offset;
-- 
2.56.0

